{"fileVersion":"1.0","metadata":{"title":"Lionel Template v1","description":"Class-backed unified grammar for Lionel episodes derived from ten observation graphs and an authoring regression trial.","graphId":"lionel-template-v1","version":"0.2.0","kind":"graph","created":"2026-08-07T14:52:00.000Z","modified":"2026-08-07T15:24:00.000Z","author":"","tags":["template","lionel","episode-grammar","class-backed","v1"],"preferredViewer":"https://twilite.zone"},"nodes":[{"id":"lionel-template-v1-declaration","type":"declaration","label":"Lionel Template v1 Declaration","position":{"x":-1180,"y":-1180},"width":460,"height":360,"ports":[{"id":"root","label":"root","direction":"bidirectional","dataType":"any","angle":210}],"visible":true,"showLabel":true,"data":{"identity":{"graphId":"lionel-template-v1","name":"Lionel Template v1","version":"0.2.0","description":"Class-backed unified grammar for modeling Lionel episodes across thesis, live, media-reaction, audit, queue, and guest compositions.","createdAt":"2026-08-07T09:52:00-05:00","updatedAt":"2026-08-07T10:24:00-05:00"},"intent":{"kind":"graph","scope":"shared","artifactKind":"template"},"declaration":{"kind":"graph","targetMode":"artifact","artifactKind":"template","defaultSurfaceId":"root","surfaces":[{"id":"root","kind":"port","label":"Lionel Template v1","memo":"Class-backed entry surface for deriving a Lionel episode graph.","portNodeId":"lionel-template-v1-root-port","viewNodeId":"lionel-template-v1-root-port","exposes":{"views":{"mode":"allow"},"declarations":{"mode":"allow"}}}]},"dependencies":{"nodeTypes":["declaration","port","bridge","markdown","lionel-episode","issue-scope","topic-thread","actor-field","research-funnel","coalition","lionel-operation","media-source","media-segment"],"portContracts":["core"],"skills":["lionel-v1"],"schemaVersions":{"nodes":">=1.0.0","ports":">=1.0.0"},"optional":["github://mikemartinez1974/public/graphs/observations-on-lionel/"]},"authority":{"mutation":{"allowCreate":true,"allowUpdate":true,"allowDelete":true,"appendOnly":false},"actors":{"humans":true,"agents":true,"tools":true},"styleAuthority":"descriptive","history":{"rewriteAllowed":false,"squashAllowed":false}},"template":{"status":"draft","strategy":"class-backed-grammar","classBacked":true,"researchBasis":"github://mikemartinez1974/public/graphs/observations-on-lionel/"}}},{"id":"lionel-template-v1-root-port","type":"port","label":"Lionel Template v1","position":{"x":-620,"y":-1180},"width":660,"height":320,"ports":[{"id":"root","label":"root","direction":"bidirectional","dataType":"any","angle":210}],"visible":true,"showLabel":false,"data":{"identity":{"graphId":"lionel-template-v1","portId":"root","name":"Lionel Template v1"},"title":"Lionel Template v1","purpose":"Model a Lionel episode with reusable class-backed analytical, navigation, media, actor, research, and rhetorical structures.","renderShape":{"kind":"markdown"},"markdown":"# 🎙️ Lionel Template v1\n\n## Class-backed episode grammar\n\nConfigure the **Episode** first. Then add only the structures the transcript actually needs.\n\n**Episode configuration** → container + sequence controller + navigation mode  \n**Topic Threads** → where the conversation goes  \n**Issue Scopes** → what question each claim or move belongs to  \n**Media Source + Segment** → exactly what outside material is referenced  \n**Lionel Operations** → reusable rhetorical moves  \n**Actor Field / Research Funnel / Coalition** → higher-order analytical structures\n\n> The template provides vocabulary, not a cage.","view":{"intent":"node","payload":"node.web.summary","label":"Lionel Template v1"},"payload":"node.web.summary","intent":"node","key":"node.web.summary","viewRole":"summary","viewKind":"display","semanticLevel":"summary","visibilityRole":"browser"}},{"id":"lionel-template-v1-instructions","type":"markdown","label":"Using Lionel Template v1","position":{"x":-160,"y":980},"width":820,"height":390,"ports":[{"id":"root","label":"root","direction":"bidirectional","dataType":"any","angle":210},{"id":"top","label":"top","direction":"bidirectional","dataType":"value","angle":270},{"id":"right","label":"right","direction":"bidirectional","dataType":"value","angle":0},{"id":"bottom","label":"bottom","direction":"bidirectional","dataType":"value","angle":90},{"id":"left","label":"left","direction":"bidirectional","dataType":"value","angle":180}],"visible":true,"showLabel":false,"data":{"identity":{"graphId":"lionel-template-v1"},"markdown":"# 🧭 Authoring Loop\n\n1. Configure **Lionel Episode**: container, sequence controller, navigation mode.\n2. Replace **Primary Issue** with the episode's actual analytical question. Duplicate Issue Scope only for a truly distinct question.\n3. Use **Topic Thread** for conversational navigation. Keep it separate from Issue Scope.\n4. Duplicate **Lionel Operation** for recurring moves such as issue analysis, analogy, scenario simulation, media commentary, perspective-taking, actor mapping, and synthesis.\n5. Add **Media Source** and **Timed Media Segment** only when outside media matters. Keep source and commentary ranges distinct.\n6. Keep **Actor Field**, **Research Funnel**, and **Coalition** only when the transcript supports them.\n7. Re-evaluate every starter semantic edge. Delete any edge that is not true in the derived episode.\n\n**Attribution rule:** transcript claims remain attributed claims. Structural observations are not evidence that the claims are true.\n\nSee `SKILL.md` for the full derivation contract."}},{"id":"lionel-template-v1-episode","type":"lionel-episode","label":"Lionel Episode","position":{"x":-200,"y":-700},"width":420,"height":300,"ports":[{"id":"root","label":"root","direction":"bidirectional","dataType":"any","angle":210},{"id":"top","label":"top","direction":"bidirectional","dataType":"value","angle":270},{"id":"right","label":"right","direction":"bidirectional","dataType":"value","angle":0},{"id":"bottom","label":"bottom","direction":"bidirectional","dataType":"value","angle":90},{"id":"left","label":"left","direction":"bidirectional","dataType":"value","angle":180}],"visible":true,"showLabel":false,"data":{"title":"Untitled Lionel Episode","sourceUrl":"","publishedAt":"","durationSeconds":0,"containerMode":"recorded-lionel-owned","sequenceController":"thesis","navigationMode":"mostly-linear","summary":"Start here. Configure what controls this episode before adding structure.","notes":"Container, sequence controller, and navigation mode are independent.","definitionKey":"lionel-episode","_classBinding":{"key":"lionel-episode","sourceRef":"github://mikemartinez1974/public/templates/lionel/v1/classes/nodes/lionel-episode.node-class.node"},"_bridge":{"classKey":"lionel-episode","classRef":"github://mikemartinez1974/public/templates/lionel/v1/classes/nodes/lionel-episode.node-class.node","entryPort":"root","kind":"node-class","sourceRef":"github://mikemartinez1974/public/templates/lionel/v1/classes/nodes/lionel-episode.node-class.node","targetKind":"node-class"},"identity":{"graphId":"lionel-template-v1"}}},{"id":"lionel-template-v1-primary-issue","type":"issue-scope","label":"Primary Issue","position":{"x":-760,"y":-220},"width":420,"height":300,"ports":[{"id":"root","label":"root","direction":"bidirectional","dataType":"any","angle":210},{"id":"top","label":"top","direction":"bidirectional","dataType":"value","angle":270},{"id":"right","label":"right","direction":"bidirectional","dataType":"value","angle":0},{"id":"bottom","label":"bottom","direction":"bidirectional","dataType":"value","angle":90},{"id":"left","label":"left","direction":"bidirectional","dataType":"value","angle":180}],"visible":true,"showLabel":false,"data":{"title":"Primary Issue","question":"What question is this episode trying to answer?","scope":"Keep this narrower than the general topic.","standard":"What would count as a meaningful answer?","burden":"","summary":"Conversation order and analytical relevance are separate.","notes":"","definitionKey":"issue-scope","_classBinding":{"key":"issue-scope","sourceRef":"github://mikemartinez1974/public/templates/lionel/v1/classes/nodes/issue-scope.node-class.node"},"_bridge":{"classKey":"issue-scope","classRef":"github://mikemartinez1974/public/templates/lionel/v1/classes/nodes/issue-scope.node-class.node","entryPort":"root","kind":"node-class","sourceRef":"github://mikemartinez1974/public/templates/lionel/v1/classes/nodes/issue-scope.node-class.node","targetKind":"node-class"},"identity":{"graphId":"lionel-template-v1"}}},{"id":"lionel-template-v1-main-thread","type":"topic-thread","label":"Main Thread","position":{"x":-250,"y":-220},"width":420,"height":300,"ports":[{"id":"root","label":"root","direction":"bidirectional","dataType":"any","angle":210},{"id":"top","label":"top","direction":"bidirectional","dataType":"value","angle":270},{"id":"right","label":"right","direction":"bidirectional","dataType":"value","angle":0},{"id":"bottom","label":"bottom","direction":"bidirectional","dataType":"value","angle":90},{"id":"left","label":"left","direction":"bidirectional","dataType":"value","angle":180}],"visible":true,"showLabel":false,"data":{"title":"Main Thread","status":"active","parentThreadId":"","returnPoint":"","branchTrigger":"","summary":"The persistent conversation thread. Duplicate for peer threads or branches.","notes":"","definitionKey":"topic-thread","_classBinding":{"key":"topic-thread","sourceRef":"github://mikemartinez1974/public/templates/lionel/v1/classes/nodes/topic-thread.node-class.node"},"_bridge":{"classKey":"topic-thread","classRef":"github://mikemartinez1974/public/templates/lionel/v1/classes/nodes/topic-thread.node-class.node","entryPort":"root","kind":"node-class","sourceRef":"github://mikemartinez1974/public/templates/lionel/v1/classes/nodes/topic-thread.node-class.node","targetKind":"node-class"},"identity":{"graphId":"lionel-template-v1"}}},{"id":"lionel-template-v1-side-thread","type":"topic-thread","label":"Side Thread","position":{"x":250,"y":-220},"width":420,"height":300,"ports":[{"id":"root","label":"root","direction":"bidirectional","dataType":"any","angle":210},{"id":"top","label":"top","direction":"bidirectional","dataType":"value","angle":270},{"id":"right","label":"right","direction":"bidirectional","dataType":"value","angle":0},{"id":"bottom","label":"bottom","direction":"bidirectional","dataType":"value","angle":90},{"id":"left","label":"left","direction":"bidirectional","dataType":"value","angle":180}],"visible":true,"showLabel":false,"data":{"title":"Side Thread","status":"suspended","parentThreadId":"lionel-template-v1-main-thread","returnPoint":"lionel-template-v1-main-thread","branchTrigger":"Audience input, association, source material, or remembered example","summary":"Optional branch starter. Delete when the episode is linear.","notes":"","definitionKey":"topic-thread","_classBinding":{"key":"topic-thread","sourceRef":"github://mikemartinez1974/public/templates/lionel/v1/classes/nodes/topic-thread.node-class.node"},"_bridge":{"classKey":"topic-thread","classRef":"github://mikemartinez1974/public/templates/lionel/v1/classes/nodes/topic-thread.node-class.node","entryPort":"root","kind":"node-class","sourceRef":"github://mikemartinez1974/public/templates/lionel/v1/classes/nodes/topic-thread.node-class.node","targetKind":"node-class"},"identity":{"graphId":"lionel-template-v1"}}},{"id":"lionel-template-v1-operation","type":"lionel-operation","label":"Opening Frame","position":{"x":-760,"y":240},"width":420,"height":300,"ports":[{"id":"root","label":"root","direction":"bidirectional","dataType":"any","angle":210},{"id":"top","label":"top","direction":"bidirectional","dataType":"value","angle":270},{"id":"right","label":"right","direction":"bidirectional","dataType":"value","angle":0},{"id":"bottom","label":"bottom","direction":"bidirectional","dataType":"value","angle":90},{"id":"left","label":"left","direction":"bidirectional","dataType":"value","angle":180}],"visible":true,"showLabel":false,"data":{"title":"Opening Frame","operationRole":"frames","startTime":"","endTime":"","target":"Primary Issue","roleDetail":"","certainty":"","summary":"Duplicate this node as Lionel performs distinct reusable moves.","notes":"","definitionKey":"lionel-operation","_classBinding":{"key":"lionel-operation","sourceRef":"github://mikemartinez1974/public/templates/lionel/v1/classes/nodes/lionel-operation.node-class.node"},"_bridge":{"classKey":"lionel-operation","classRef":"github://mikemartinez1974/public/templates/lionel/v1/classes/nodes/lionel-operation.node-class.node","entryPort":"root","kind":"node-class","sourceRef":"github://mikemartinez1974/public/templates/lionel/v1/classes/nodes/lionel-operation.node-class.node","targetKind":"node-class"},"identity":{"graphId":"lionel-template-v1"}}},{"id":"lionel-template-v1-actor-field","type":"actor-field","label":"Actor Field","position":{"x":-250,"y":240},"width":420,"height":300,"ports":[{"id":"root","label":"root","direction":"bidirectional","dataType":"any","angle":210},{"id":"top","label":"top","direction":"bidirectional","dataType":"value","angle":270},{"id":"right","label":"right","direction":"bidirectional","dataType":"value","angle":0},{"id":"bottom","label":"bottom","direction":"bidirectional","dataType":"value","angle":90},{"id":"left","label":"left","direction":"bidirectional","dataType":"value","angle":180}],"visible":true,"showLabel":false,"data":{"title":"Actor Field","issue":"Primary Issue","actors":"","pattern":"","summary":"Optional. Use when relationships among several actors matter to the analysis.","notes":"","definitionKey":"actor-field","_classBinding":{"key":"actor-field","sourceRef":"github://mikemartinez1974/public/templates/lionel/v1/classes/nodes/actor-field.node-class.node"},"_bridge":{"classKey":"actor-field","classRef":"github://mikemartinez1974/public/templates/lionel/v1/classes/nodes/actor-field.node-class.node","entryPort":"root","kind":"node-class","sourceRef":"github://m